    "title": "Oregon City Elects 26-Year-Old Adam Marl, First Asian American Mayor - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amina Rashid ,\n1 days ago\nOregon City voters have elected 26-year-old Adam Marl as their next mayor, making him the city’s first Asian American mayor and only the second person of color to hold the office. Early returns showed Marl with 71% of the vote, far outpacing his two challengers in a race that capped a fast political rise for a man who was once the youngest person ever to sit on the city commission.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n5",
